# Global taste

This repo carries git-backed global taste synced from `skills-taste`.

- Read `.agents/taste/{category}/taste.md` when working in that domain.
- Category rules under `.cursor/rules/imported/taste/` scope by file globs.
- Per-repo overrides live in `.cursor/rules/taste-*.mdc`.

Promotion and learning run via Cursor automations; local Agent chat receives taste through these rules and skills only (not Memories directly).
